y at peace with his  life and we're told  with that he entrusts his hopes and  desires to his comrades  goosebump inducing moment right here and  not just because he looks extremely cold  i don't know if hyogoro will actually  die here but  it would be a fitting end for him no  doubt  the only thing is the fact that oda  didn't kill him  in this chapter which suggests to me  that he might not actually die right  away but hey there's oda at it again  giving us more reasons and questions  that make us desperate for the next  chapter to come out as soon  as possible like kyogro oda is clearly a  master at his craft  but that is it for this chapter which  was most definitely an epic one  as usual let me know how you like this  chapter and what you're expecting to see  happen in the next one let me know who  your mvp for this chapter was  drop that in the comments if you do  enjoy seeing these one-piece chapter  reviews i want to keep them coming the  best  you can do is channel the pirate king  within and smash that like button until  it's blue  if you haven't be sure to subscribe and  hit that notification bell so you  actually know when a new video drops and  while you wait a week for the next  chapter to drop feel free to check out  my growing  one piece playlist where you'll find  videos about the yonko warlord supernova  and much more link to that is in the  description  and i especially want to thank the  patron squad over on patreon and here on  youtube who helped make videos like this  one possible first and foremost i want  to thank  the patron of legend the one  acknowledged by lord tuigo himself  and the most donated champion of the  world alpha sigma  and are the one tier patrons the ones  who stand atop all clans  in grotto the world acquire respect but  they have a liam thompson al-jatal  dr cortman johnny boy draws emperor  otaku  spidey life to now baked buddhist and  tungsten tarkis and our pro hero tier  patrons the one and only gilgamesh  steelers  an